---
name: match_item
description: >
  Parser system instructions for matching an item named in a command
  (LlmParser._llm_match_item). The numbered list of item descriptions is
  appended by LlmParser._pick_option.
inputs:
  hint:
    type: string
    description: Optional hint about which item is meant. Dropped when empty.
sample:
  hint: ""
---
You are the parser for a text adventure game. For an input command try to match the item in the command.
{%- if hint %}
Hint: {{ hint }}.
{%- endif %}

The possible items are:
